# 必考词 Unit 17 短语

## 常考短语

- **interpret…as**: 把…理解为 — His silence was interpreted as agreement. 他的沉默被理解为同意。
- **at intervals**: 不时地 — The doctor checks on the patient at regular intervals. 医生定期检查病人。
- **be intimate with**: 与…亲密 — She is intimate with several colleagues. 她与几位同事关系密切。
- **invest in**: 投资于 — She invested in real estate. 她投资了房地产。
- **be involved in**: 参与 — He was involved in the accident. 他卷入了事故。
- **isolate…from**: 把…与…隔离 — The patient was isolated from others. 病人被与其他人隔离。
- **at issue**: 争论中的 — The point at issue is whether we should expand. 争论的焦点是我们是否应该扩张。
- **take issue with**: 对…持异议 — I take issue with your conclusion. 我对你的结论持异议。
- **judge by/from**: 根据…判断 — Don't judge a person by his appearance. 不要以貌取人。
- **justify doing sth.**: 证明做某事是合理的 — How can you justify lying? 你怎么能证明撒谎是合理的？
- **be keen on**: 热衷于 — She is keen on painting. 她热衷于绘画。
- **lag behind**: 落后于 — The company is lagging behind its rivals. 公司落后于竞争对手。
- **launch a campaign**: 发起运动 — The charity launched a campaign to raise awareness. 慈善机构发起了一场提高意识的运动。
- **leap at**: 迫不及待地接受 — She leaped at the opportunity to study abroad. 她迫不及待地接受了出国留学的机会。
- **by leaps and bounds**: 飞速地 — Technology is advancing by leaps and bounds. 技术正在飞速发展。
- **take a lease on**: 租用 — They took a lease on the office space. 他们租用了办公空间。
- **at leisure**: 闲暇时 — You can read the report at leisure. 你可以在闲暇时阅读报告。
- **be liberal with**: 慷慨地使用 — She is liberal with praise. 她毫不吝啬赞美。
- **within the limits of**: 在…的范围内 — You must work within the limits of the budget. 你必须在预算范围内工作。
- **investigate into**: 调查 — The committee will investigate into the matter. 委员会将调查此事。
